==Legislation==
{{main|Bikeway and legislation}}in California new bikeway design standards were last adopted in 1976. Those designs were adapted by the Association of American State Highway and Transportation Officials ([[AASHTO]]) to become the AASHTO Guide for Bicycle Facilities, which is followed in the USA.

